<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1555] Exception thrown when a test example has the label not present in training examples</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1555</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently an IllegalArgumentException is thrown when a test example has the label (belongs to the class) not present in training examples. When the number of labels is big, such a situation is likely and valid. The example of course will be misclassified, but exception should not be thrown. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
